<title>POLAND: Warsaw bourse suspends Novita trade.</title>
<headline>Warsaw bourse suspends Novita trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange suspended trade in Polish carpet maker Novita SA shares on Thursday's session, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and a bourse official said the exchange would comment on the decision after the market's close at 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Novita has not yet published its August earnings report, due by Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
